  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "you should join the team and agree on the team's domain. Once that is done,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "create a process model and check it."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If the process model is \"NOT OK\", then assign negative points."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If it is still \"NOT OK\", assign negative points again."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "However, if the process is okay, you can continue with it."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "If there are any issues, fix them in the next session and extend the process to levels 2 and 3."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "If you need to check the process and assign points, continue with the process. If you need to analyze the field of study, assign roles in the team."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "If the process is okay, continue with the process and perform work according to your assigned role. Check the progress and consult any problems that arise."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "If the project is accepted, present it. If not, continue working according to your role."
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "content": "If the project is accepted, present it again. If not, continue working according to your role. Finally, present the project and the process will come to an end."
    }
  ]
